#ASSERT `Was the intimidation an offence` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `an offence, with a fine of up to 100 penalty units`
#ASSERT `Was the intimidation an offence` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not an offence under this section on these facts`
#ASSERT `Was the intimidation an offence` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `this section gives the person a defence on these facts`
#ASSERT `Was the intimidation an offence` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not an offence under this section on these facts`

#ASSERT `Was the reprisal an offence` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `an offence, with a fine of up to 100 penalty units`
